{"language_code":"eng","language_probability":0.9614678621292114,"text":"Hermes is the always-on layer running on GLM 5.2, and it is deliberately the cheapest thing in the system because it is the only part that never stops. It reads fifteen-second windows, keeps a rolling ninety seconds, and compares each actor against its own recent baseline. The features are counts and shapes, request volume, distinct paths, path entropy, denial ratio, endpoints never seen before from this identity, distinct source addresses, cross-tenant attempts, canary touches, and how fast the actor pivots after a denial. None of those is a violation. Hermes is not deciding guilt. It decides whether something deserves a real look, and that is the only judgment it is trusted with.","words":[{"text":"Hermes","start":0.119,"end":0.56,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0006233100502868183},{"text":" ","start":0.56,"end":0.62,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.0847986231965479e-05},{"text":"is","start":0.62,"end":0.74,"type":"word","logprob":-1.0847986231965479e-05},{"text":" ","start":0.74,"end":0.799,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.2040065485052764e-05},{"text":"the","start":0.799,"end":0.919,"type":"word","logprob":-1.2040065485052764e-05},{"text":" ","start":0.919,"end":0.979,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0009700122172944248},{"text":"always-on","start":0.979,"end":1.5,"type":"word","logprob":-0.003233021327711564},{"text":" ","start":1.5,"end":1.579,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00010644822759786621},{"text":"layer","start":1.579,"end":1.839,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00010644822759786621},{"text":" ","start":1.839,"end":2.239,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.10052186250686646},{"text":"running","start":2.24,"end":2.46,"type":"word","logprob":-0.10052186250686646},{"text":" ","start":2.46,"end":2.519,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.1920922133867862e-06},{"text":"on","start":2.519,"end":2.599,"type":"word","logprob":-1.1920922133867862e-06},{"text":" ","start":2.599,"end":2.719,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00293